6:["$","$L13",null,{"services":[{"deliverables":["Project discovery & strategy","UX structure and wireframes","Custom design in Figma","Webflow build with animations","CMS setup and team training"],"description":"Pixel-perfect Webflow builds with custom animations, clean CMS structure and training for your team.","relatedCaseSlugs":null,"slug":"webflow-development","summary":"Begin Webflow development with our Project Discovery session, aligning our team with your goals, timeline, and required functionalities. We prioritize understanding your content strategy, feature needs, and desired user experiences.","timeline":"4â€“8 weeks","title":"Webflow development"},{"deliverables":["Stakeholder and user research","Information architecture","Wireframes and user flows","High-fidelity UI design","Component library and handover"],"description":"Research-led interface design. Structure, flows and a component system your team can build from.","relatedCaseSlugs":null,"slug":"ux-ui-design","summary":"Join our UX/UI Design Workshop to kickstart your design journey. We'll analyze user experiences, pinpoint issues, and create a strategic vision for an engaging interface that aligns with business goals and user needs.","timeline":"3â€“6 weeks","title":"UX/UI design"},{"deliverables":["Brand discovery workshop","Positioning and messaging","Logo and visual identity","Type, colour and imagery system","Brand guidelines"],"description":"A brand identity built to work everywhere it lands: on the site, in the deck, and in the product.","relatedCaseSlugs":null,"slug":"branding","summary":"By partnering with us for your branding needs, you receive a step-by-step, personalized experience that results in a compelling and memorable brand identity, ready to make its mark in your industry and beyond.","timeline":"4â€“6 weeks","title":"Branding"},{"deliverables":["Pre-launch QA and performance pass","Go-live and DNS handover","CMS walkthrough and training","Monthly updates and monitoring","Priorit